<title>USA: Sioux City hogs $2.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs $2.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $2.00 lower. Trade moderate. Top $58.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     58.00</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     57.00-57.50</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     55.00-56.50</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     51.50-54.50</p>
<p>Sows:  All weights 0.50-1.50 lower. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-450 lbs     46.00</p>
<p>	   450-500 lbs     46.50</p>
<p>	   500-550 lbs     scarce</p>
<p>	   550-700 lbs     49.00</p>
</text>
